# This file previously contained a hardcoded RSA private key which has been removed for security.
# Provide a TLS private key via the TLS_KEY_PATH environment variable or generate one:
#   openssl req -x509 -nodes -days 365 -newkey rsa:2048 -keyout server.key -out server.crt
# IMPORTANT: The previous key committed to this repository must be rotated (revoked/reissued)
# because it remains in git history.
